@startuml F1.6-D01-listar-comunicacoes
title F1.6-D01 — Listagem de comunicações
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "CommunicationsController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: abre /comunicacao
note right of WebApp: DS/Skeleton

WebApp -> Jwt: GET /communications
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT lista\n+ COUNT não lidos por tipo
Postgres --> Ctrl: dados
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 + _links
note right of WebApp
  useActions(_links)
  marcar-lido / CTAs Inbox
end note
WebApp --> Aluno: tabs + lista

@enduml
